ary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le06ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Past Continuous Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Past Continuous tense to talk about something that was happening at a particular time in the past.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "This is how you form the Past Continuous tense:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "subject + was/were + verb-ing<br> I was cooking. <br>It was raining.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You often use the Past Continuous tense together with the Simple Past tense.<br> The Past Continuous talks about a longer 'background' action. <br>The Simple Past talks about a shorter event that happened in the middle of, or interrupted, the longer event.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the words <span class=\"strong\">when</span> and <span class=\"strong\">while</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the timeline:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "engenn5le06ob11img01.jpg", "type": "image"}, {"content": "While I was walking in Jerusalem, I saw a beautiful window!", "type": "example"}, {"content": " When I read your email, I was hanging out with Marco.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "gorgeous", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very beautiful ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The new sous chef is gorgeous!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le06ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Comparative and Superlative Adjectives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a co