llable adjectives:  more + adjective + than <br> or<br>the most + adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good<br>bad\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"better (than) <br> worse (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the best<br>the worst\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Irregular comparisons\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<ul><li> You use <span class=\"strong\">than</span> after comparatives.</li><li>  You add <span class=\"strong\">the</span> in front of the superlative form to describe people, places and things.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It was the strangest thing!", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "strange", "type": "name"}, {"content": "odd; unusual ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Everyone I meet is really strange!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le06ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mysterious ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "difficult to understand or know ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like my men mysterious and quiet.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le06ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to hang out ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to spend time with someone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm hanging out with Marco.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le06ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "rainbow", "type": "name"}, {"content": "different colors in the sky caused by light going through water ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_spee